## Part 10: Integrated IDE
:::

===
# Integrated IDE Feature

This presentation includes **integrated IDE** functionality!

- Compile and run Python / JavaScript / SQL
- Monaco editor with VS Code-like syntax highlighting
- Customize editor and output positions for better layout
- Perfect for live coding demonstrations

