## Part 12: Fragment Animations
:::

===
# Fragment Animations

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
Fragment animations let you **reveal content incrementally**
:::

::: {animate: "fade-up"}
This text slides up while fading in
:::

::: {animate: "highlight-blue"}
And this one highlights in blue!
:::

===
# Various Fragment Effects

::: {animate: "fade-out"}
This will fade out
:::

::: {animate: "grow"}
This will grow larger
:::

::: {animate: "shrink"}
This will shrink
:::

::: {animate: "strike"}
This gets struck through
:::

===
# Nested Fragments

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
::: {animate: "highlight-red"}
::: {animate: "semi-fade-out"}
Fade in → Turn red → Semi fade out
:::
:::
:::

===
# Custom Order

::: {animate: "fade-in" index: 3}
**Third**: This appears last
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in" index: 1}
**First**: This appears first
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in" index: 2}
**Second**: This appears in the middle
:::

===
# Fragments with Lists

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
- First batch of items
- Appears together
:::

::: {animate: "highlight-green"}
- Second batch
- Highlights in green
:::

